## 4. Networking Basics

### Check open ports

```bash
ss -tulnp
netstat -tulnp
```

### Connectivity testing

```bash
ping host
curl http://url
wget url
telnet host port
nc host port
```

### DNS

```bash
nslookup google.com
dig google.com
```

