## 6. Logs & Debugging

### Log locations

* `/var/log`

### View logs

```bash
tail -f /var/log/syslog
journalctl -u service
journalctl -xe
```

### journalctl

* systemd log manager

---

## 7. Users & Groups

### User management

```bash
useradd user
passwd user
```

### Switch user

```bash
su - user
sudo -i
```

### su vs sudo

* `su` – switch user
* `sudo` – run command as root

