## 12. Common Linux Failure Scenarios

### Disk full

```bash
df -h
du -sh /* | sort -h
journalctl --vacuum-time=7d
```

### Service not starting

```bash
systemctl status service
journalctl -xe
```

### High CPU usage

```bash
top
ps aux --sort=-%cpu
```

### Permission denied

* Check ownership
* Check SELinux

```bash
getenforce
```

